      <film:notes>Trips from my motorcycle trip to Prague, taking photos of brutalist architecture.</film:notes>
      <film:category>architecture</film:category>
      <film:visionRaw>A tall, slender broadcast tower rises into a bright sky above a multi-story concrete structure. The building features several cantilevered observation platforms and large columns supporting the upper sections. Dark tree branches frame the left side of the high-contrast image.</film:visionRaw>
